# Resume Game, SaveAnywhere: ON (fixtures/snapcfg: the CD's LBA.CFG
# with the key): a new game, which starts at once, its text and movie
# cut, a walk in the cell. Escape writes the game into current.lba and
# opens the main menu over it, under current.lba's picture, and Resume
# Game goes on with the game where it stood, the scene drawn whole
# without a fade. A walk, then Escape again and Quit, which ends the
# program, current.lba keeping the game for the next start (continue).

sleep 40
shot menu
key Return
sleep 20
key Escape
sleep 15
key Escape
sleep 10
shot cell
down Up
sleep 1.2
up Up
key Left
sleep 2
shot walked
key Escape
sleep 3
shot pause
key Return
sleep 2
shot resumed
down Up
sleep 0.8
up Up
sleep 1
shot moved
key Escape
sleep 3
key Down Down Down Down Down Return
sleep 3
